@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 1. Crear una sede
POST {{baseUrl}}/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sede Centro", "city": "Montería", "address": "Calle 30 #5-20" }

### 2. Listar sedes
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations

### 3. Validación: debe fallar con 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/locations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sede Norte" }